{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1248,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cad95a184e04453ed9a1777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光明同学推荐我穿白色的紧身裤啊～\r\n……那可是相当认真的眼神呐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "485a3bbe8f563eec33b49cbef6228375331fcf7843e5a2a551f47b8dbcb73b34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5425496484f2c042893c7620",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是在我小声嘀咕着没有合适的外套之后，\r\n圣王给我准备的……\r\n但我是明白的……这绝对很贵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "109c9a98547770c2da81454c18041ba5ef574feacc323d8f68584dfafef49996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2114e5a1830a835b808a018c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50a02cafaefff2c87cad55cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09737afb272c5024541ab2e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员每天都要陪着我们，\r\n真是辛苦耶～\r\n偶尔也休息一下吧～？嘻嘻嘻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "297c258e51963116cee0054b31db521ceb2be3091f1cc2a1de7071e5906d1c70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a51ed71c351d28374b99046",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未读信息超过十个之后，\r\n就会懒得再看手机了。\r\n……哇，又变多了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "72deef82f30492baa796a9403e1d6a976cfdf0fbfcc61230ee857e0f2176600e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:499c6bb7a6f36f98d5d34b4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得进闸门很浪费时间吗？\r\n里面莫名地又闷又挤……唉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a668f31d8384af150e9c8620271d1dc19abec0f1485a90e640aa5d43dfca131",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f63d31d6b7153a4e97f8426",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啊，对了。\r\n见到圣王可以帮我传话吗——？\r\n叫她“不要浪费时间来找我”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "521d283f2a9a352f204e6576653ec198ce6ad1cacd6022d3345d5acb784eb77c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cec95e92943bcedda57d0032",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以惹小草生气。\r\n……我再说一次哦？\r\n千万不可以惹小草生气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6806d02c2796326123a1912fa10a1379ab9e0e52e465bcb355ac1157f2eda9ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d8a06d056215db32fc69905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没想到我穿上这衣服的日子\r\n居然来了……真令我惊讶。\r\n居然是会露出肚脐的衣服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "94198b7f712c874eae2b2651ab8e61ee481c0f0939ccf5cba02a6f71b27c3da9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a26fbb33911d87196e6b1eb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我把领口稍微弄松了。\r\n反正又看不出来，没差对吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c84277a371bad6d67ba048f2e4652cdd5b6f7af2545ceed6f8248ce9d29f8c7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:662218f2305426f49429c769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然会特地给我决胜服——\r\n……该不会……是对我有所期待吧？\r\n啊哈哈，青酱我伤脑筋了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d9ded58234a02b3fa08b56da8cad0d2da3b0cfb4832b780bcaf87b0b8d5b7de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ca07fa0b8b6f690cb8eced4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是衣服还是比赛都要轻松～\r\n都照我的步调吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "80c774721d4659bcb1b8595a05722a027f0bff724e3183d9db23c46e58acad75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9d799be5cdcaa64743b31fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论我多早起来，\r\n永远都会看到小鹰在跑步——\r\n反正我是学不来的啦——呼啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83082d40df0dafeeedd09741ab8996af88f7ecb843b896835fd2b9b1fe9a1f5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3eb97531b96fee7df3bba9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小特吃饭时总是吃得很香呢～\r\n……是说她的胃，\r\n到底是通到什么地方啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c740626efa6fa6371f00b9e88153a9905fab5cd7c6a69281c3efc2754249eb86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2055e7d50af784b9b72ca95d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早点睡……之类的，\r\n像小花一样的叮咛我可不听哦，\r\n我睡觉的时间由我决定！现在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab8c62feffacee9ca53d8576958c8f50ed1e878f9ee2a68143d8eb1e205ba2dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d50ccbee1794fe5fb332ad94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气变得越来越温暖了～\r\n好想要一直躺在草地上哦——\r\n……最好是一辈子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "596626344492aef1477c28b4e3fddf2258619dfe9e75aa73dc88768c2bd22f9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1165f15c27e2337f48007f7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天要小心中暑哦！\r\n我得一直赖在家里不出门才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde10f286b07b17fdfcc01a90a9b0b1d846312198b8b031fde3555ba2ee4facc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a75bcc938bfa9a77333997b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节就是要吃秋刀鱼呢——\r\n虽然不容易钓到……\r\n但这样才有钓的价值嘛——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df7890dd472d7cd834b86585953fb15eeab10b316843c282616709126617352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c95026682add954c913aa859",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔——真的好冷哦——\r\n这种时候还是\r\n跟小猫咪窝在一起取暖好了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f0352ba91fc97a32df1d4a723eea402d689d3fd8481b759748ad7e56e69be75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce2afe599545761ac9600ecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……我的领结系得很漂亮吗？\r\n这个嘛……虽然不是我自己弄的。\r\n但我会帮你转达给她的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5851be5063acd976d6551a84878ac72ffdecf08297a5432f379a89efb9824c09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a192a79f8c73c0b556499218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小特他们，说着“好帅啊”什么的捉弄我。\r\n小青好可怜哦～呜呜呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51a742854766919ce5d8b8b5e5885b865a6cbfd243d0b2787a6ae61e03ef173e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d69d5f590d2e9325ec2cdb75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……富士同学，不在这里吧？\r\n最近，跳舞的邀请太频繁了☆\r\n如果看见她的话请帮我瞒过去………",
      "source_fingerprint": "40fdb664a48d0e6c2f9f860da557121d3638ec295045a9b0a33ccb4f3bcfc798",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a15a907900710885ef244c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神宫同学的电脑\r\n是一个特别厉害的情报宝库哦。\r\n……要不要试试去做个交易呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7927b3cf71badca04da743f9f270e35ecaec1bcb0361f6cef861b3482bcd1c41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07b0604925837eb39807e2be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "配合着节奏one two☆\r\n……之类的，不太适合我呢。\r\n还是随性地上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0256bd11e4ccc8c2944a2d72b887ad0cdd62bdc57bfdc7cef45c0410c617e88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0401be30e1fcf1efbee6c641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～……啊，在偷看呀～\r\n这种时候把视线移开才符合礼仪……\r\n说到底就不该在人前打哈欠？诶嘿☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a594c06b47f2dead0909d0061fc311639e63d5f20affc4b1b85a5ff3549d41a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d70375100846b92ca0e80b50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戴着手套吃饭的秘诀……\r\n那就是，让别人喂我吃！\r\n所以，啊——♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "094b96396a357c6d3b9582cfcef31ea73ccf0a3bcbb443f2ea1277c37ccf6b8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0617637ee2f54f3af22e780d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，该去睡觉了吧？\r\n我会在梦中与你一起舞蹈的啦",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d939e371f66931548171c56b65363b1759cc6879119af1552b3ce309a2234df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13a2348545b4b983d474db24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞会啊——虽然很有\r\n讲究排场的特雷森学园的风格。\r\n但接下来……算了，只是在边上看一下的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83efddafec81fd152254299ba7a44638a11a5c53afc79726b6d2805b6c04961e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60ce440e69b91b4594c26292",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……什么啊，你那好像在说\r\n“光看着就觉得很热”的脸。\r\n我跟你讲～……太对了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b064e7d8e9c7c8831436c5b35ee40ac75b11f3342042b038a8f6688d32e877c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9a9bc967da6022235c6cd6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我对古典音乐没什么兴趣，\r\n但要是在落叶之中听的话还挺不错的呢～\r\n……因为可以睡得很香☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1700caa0271442f0beb49dc3296ff587255979ea15aa5eec8d0fd735c822e6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efea46edae9a50c1c2ab8875",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜哇～膝盖好冷！\r\n于是乎，江洋大盗登场！\r\n外套借我一下啦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7f8c4f418210607bb1f9e0e054c1ec9cdbdf32c3abe2cbf804bdb838dd18987",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87605cca02870c1f56f166f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人说现在的我，“像个大人一样令人十分紧张”什么的。\r\n真伤脑筋呢～……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff436d7d10be5d7850644554f628cc3dec346207d6ed80728f54fbfc2b8462f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da8b24ca2b23662612b505a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刘海？啊，当我在想事情的时候，\r\n偶尔会把它撩上去。\r\n于是就这样定型了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4db8529560b8bb6e186a497a7eed36bd172b06290922c0e977d3e4f6a2e17274",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69dec413025a156aa76546ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不着急、不着急～\r\n还是悠闲地照着自己的步调过吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8245efd69b245f992e0008a3cfc0f87b522443b1cf952699300d6147d2508fbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aba7ea2ead37af761563d63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきますかー",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4aa9a93153319d5f8151046bd4df1d9acb6aa8f3870fbed14e61632392e7d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14014bae18cd52060afe8210",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有谁能来代替我跑步啊——",
      "source_fingerprint": "34fd9537422ee6299a87b45ca140c170857c165794aa5e7467fb0a6130db5cbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fafb2d9e92a6fc4235511e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我就稍微去努力个一下吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c2d6dddf63ef776179b32492323649d267732395649ac73825f3d7c81653d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da751ecbfc9eaf780c0acd15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇——哦。\r\n原来是到了训练的时间啦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "09829770d3ae1f737c83d9467009e2112a44c8a16d0c4f2d52a8f46f9c6a986a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:450aa93b4152dac7e8238c30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也来认真跑一下好了，\r\n用脚踏车……说笑的啦。\r\n我偶尔也是会好好表现的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84e7fdbbe8a32db1de6dabadd59ae5a32e5144f497ede201913271936341e9d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71433b4734df0629363b23d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，总之呢，想要跑出一场\r\n大家都觉得有趣的比赛呢，呀哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c40031bbd7c58d2ca7763b7b7872cddd7c265a2b13af15adbcde0d11fa50a782",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab5f73b50858633561975c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就当作是搭到了宝船，\r\n全都交给我吧。\r\n掌舵就靠你咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d27921edacf4d366b6b109baec95d7f7e33dadc4a303d1ef2c56ff8ea036be9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b4cf996bbc40c1002bd2f48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀——\r\n训练的时候我再好好做就是了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9b74f458842c1c1c4774e5430c5a4bf7635451b737e8c7025f3700bc17a6be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cc7f5836b5778e7c37510db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要当护花使者吗？\r\n……送到跑道为止，啊这，\r\n诶嘿嘿，决定不了呀～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9725a3ece5839b201483916a3170ee58bcc52867fb2730c57c48721c510bab44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd311d5a805f24c4db74d54c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啊，刚才你在看我的脚下对吧？\r\n短筒袜带可是很方便的哦？\r\n好，作为惩罚让你跑十圈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a5a8ad914334af10cf6fd50576f2a25b67fa57a37b566aa6d396f7a631d95e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2d22ecba2540066ea9ddc72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将华尔兹的舞步运用于跑步之中……\r\n唔，不太行啊～不，\r\n能不能利用一下节奏感呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fc9d661669ec6b7d6baf75ca1005651c0151a714d10359b568fe54a19eec4d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ebfd26bd2edd2b2bb022184",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要在大家面前跳舞啊～\r\n真是大胆呀，啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab5d35aefc7e22ae3cdf3aa4ba747633bf3996a097cd1598c4ef3a22165b4cdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95fa4ce05b96139aea15efed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，今天的训练内容是？\r\n一切悉听尊便。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49f4fdcf7e050a33009e2fcbaf8dc74feb72ce6b1dd0ba00fb9d0bf544a94d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2afb0b7b51b431136f236147",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“我好想休息一下呀～”\r\n……哦呀，不知从哪儿\r\n传来了一声天真无邪的请求。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f434866cd8c0ff2f6917fe6d301e03b807b760f374fd139e09bef2d4ec51e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26bea1f1ebbcb54cc48bd355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请让我在训练员的带领下，\r\n变得更加强大吧。\r\n……之后自然就会赢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d962ff0ee15c27341a3bb10549da196ff7006963b14c1c7383b6e67cbe420f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e48710431b78bfee79c0d74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然能把我培养到这种地步！\r\n真是个好策士呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a691d731a6edf9701da79befccbd9fad6b7095a0f8890df75bec0a1f545b7d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e5dd344eb4c2b240f5fcc8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀，\r\n看来我好像也挺厉害的嘛——",
      "source_fingerprint": "572f824054086a37bbbded11eb332ff5ce356430be79280605e81b08ad09d180",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:723c94a954dc9d9037e028d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢～……我很开心哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "564e2c850d4e5c7ea0dfb2e5e1d1d535fc5d4cb6b1b9685700508741b41ad2bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dd4a8970a7d05ab3175a74a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最棒的组合，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "513300e5b3468446ecb05f223ce5e027675527869eb25a99533f7d21926be2ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f81081ee4fca5e4f74f0932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该不会是传说中的成长期吧～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eee5c019216c576181b5e108a105034c253e3f915eb895a4d2cba765ea0222e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c29577a4da27370055f524cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以为这已经……是我的极限？\r\n才不是呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed2d19724bb9fcaeb8840c54f44ce9980bb699fed8dbf5aaf846de1b990ba432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48b0de9d2ce86804748d6a36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨嗨——我是青云天空哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1b483128176d458ea998ecc34e781cc01a807733a5e8528e2466bad36c378dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad1d986dca9933403e96d61d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要一起来掀起大骚动呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "43dea1c58f6350e2311ceb2c49956930609f6390cb5d42de34f1cfcfb9067238",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c76e635d49d7cbc02e8c65df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是打算要去帮忙吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b900e429751e74fee0286f8342ce07cb322fdd8291b3fdd27a9fa412f7fe4711",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aa28b9893633c031409e879",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇——哦，可以拜托你的意思吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "520067c1b4381fe0bffaf1638c6b6f8d62e0afa5de9fd63b8ed1ae5321d3b5e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f302e224c13ed87826645f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说不定我长高了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d441c435137cf6fce47561981c58a0af6d56ef665569e332ec28ff72ff7ae0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8552b91a81c6fa92ae4ac80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来一首曲子庆祝一下，怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "36c834df6838f7cc1a5932ac45b221492da4d32afe69a8f576a0b58347d26ad8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:432a1c2dd93f827b0e67312c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛也好，跳舞也好，\r\n太普通的话就没意思了，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e5b77520a2688da8a43531b9c556511e8d4b2113f0645a15106715f82c708e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93801c613d6664a199e0be9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是青云天空，\r\n需要我当你的护花使者吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "80936e0d6ea635f2022a94fd282216d5ce19942c47b744fcf6abe4c0415ac02a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:884ad104ef928fb655fb23b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6861a1222a83096c184d05beb9eff554b1a5385a4910b681f3bf859f5335b970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee0f23d1316350cf9fd11b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老是顾着往上看，\r\n会忘了重要的事情。也得好好重视\r\n自己的心情才行啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "782fd2297632a44a79eb15fdcdb712a928d060d56cc667b00772650a88e9d0cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e02f008f931502c7ecb3e8dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "076958d6edb2f260b21d167257369e37d3898f76a77de1e4241c36926e4d761f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c397e106fb5da3456701b5e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2ae3e885116456615ee2bd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还没……还没习惯……！\r\n奖赏自己……！呜～\r\n好讨厌小家子气的自己……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe18662f475f10df5130bf5e550c6b91e0f21dca32c6d21436adc4f212677d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a39c8f32bd9bee63fbb645f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还想再吃松饼啊……\r\n好松软啊──呃，不行这样，\r\n我变得跟小栗一样了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6af1e598c530ecfc7ef8e9a335bb18f3608897c9cc3eec5637a3772077371b11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef433a2ea62d90e6582cdb94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n欸欸，要不要去新年参拜？\r\n去逛逛各家摊贩吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "715feea5317c4465a3194e2c88cdc3a77fb5f2bc7218fa74e2fc5b3c9580e408",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b685acfe8d88fbcc40b5b2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我收到了一堆巧克力！\r\n身边的人真的都对我很好。\r\n大家都好温柔，心里暖烘烘的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf10653e82fe1c359578fc5ef1790f11111c2f63f2379d7915bf169a118f4bcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c3fef3f5e449e07425b6884",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我独家特制的饼干，加了\r\n营养丰富的豆渣！……外观虽然\r\n不好看但很好吃喔。真、真的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65c04d8613ea745c0d27b72e70a8ccfb6e517331f4b0f1023fc1fec7df404881",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ccbd36e4eb355cc795ed9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请让我再长高一点──\r\n唔哇！？你在啊！刚刚我说的\r\n是那个啦！就那个啊……那个！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a4d63fae3ed7e264de7303ffc2eb2946431f1382c32ae063586fc4607e5b854",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21374762912c4afde48ff106",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摆了好多南瓜……\r\n不能带一个回去吗……？\r\n……应该可以吃一个礼拜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7e18ff45c1ee613cd6f97adaf05b4dca96e8b41467d181a16c57ff0025af13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b03a3d89cd6eae996254b852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小不点们今天应该\r\n津津有味地吃着鸡肉饭吧～\r\n嘿嘿，害我也突然想吃了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c16dcf2eed2c7e26e9a302d0b0c6fe79481147dc1aec9f4ee7b8d75bc7e91a4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d00eaa7ce40432d279c5da9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好喔，圣诞节！\r\n大家看起来都很开心享受……\r\n是说，你的表情也都松懈下来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce97d6258fd12e7bdd9a60c48e4ad59fd985597d8096b8b64f48f1086587928",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e08e4620172d916793aeebef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61001b03d3bd62444b0e3108412891d24ae8c73521b01502f1ef914bf0928b70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3acb8f7d729ecbe72cdd903",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大扫除结束了吗？有扫干净吗？\r\n可不能积灰尘喔！\r\n要以清爽的心情迎接新年！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ea5e4f0c0c5e1be7e856ecd08bc78f50412cb36af99c604b214eb62bcf6f87a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:652821b134ac546b5d87f121",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去食堂吧！\r\n我想稍微努力，做个蛋糕看看！\r\n来盛大地帮你庆生吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50a0d15f4334b55dde0b1e2fb8e10a8163a8d6993612e2b3f6253f80efd7584f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "10011"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
